Fix linking of the Luckfox FocalTech touch driver (CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_FTS=y).

focaltech_test/ was listed inside the composite object focaltech-ts-y, so the
linker got the directory as an archive member ("member ... focaltech_test in
archive is not an object"). Build it as a normal subdirectory instead.

--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_touch/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/focaltech_touch/Makefile
@@ -15,5 +15,5 @@
 focaltech-ts-y += focaltech_i2c.o
 focaltech-ts-y += focaltech_point_report_check.o
 focaltech-ts-y += focaltech_upgrade_ft8201.o
-focaltech-ts-y += focaltech_test/
+obj-$(CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN_FTS) += focaltech_test/

